          >, plus <strong>2,000 additional sq. ft. for each additional unit</strong> (requiring <strong
            >6,000 sq. ft.</strong
          >
          for 3 units and <strong>8,000 sq. ft.</strong> for 4 units). Classic 4,000 sq. ft. triple-decker lots are banned
          from having a 3-family home unless you drop down to 1 or 2 units.
        </p>
      </div>

