        </div>
        <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
          A 0.8 Floor Area Ratio Caps Total Space at 3,200 sq. ft.
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Even inside the 25&prime; &times; 50&prime; setback box (1,250 sq. ft./floor), a 3-story building totals 3,750
          sq. ft. (<strong>0.94 FAR</strong>)&mdash;violating the <strong>0.80 maximum FAR (3,200 sq. ft.)</strong> and the
          <strong>1,950 sq. ft. Usable Open Space</strong> requirement (650 sq. ft. per unit outside the front yard).
